    },
    {
      "id": "0yoGi",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Volume of water coming out of the pipe per sec&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Mass of water hitting the wall per second&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>As the water hits the wall normal to the wall and stops, the change of momentum of water hitting the wall is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Since, the change of momentum obtained is per unit time, it is same as the force. &nbsp;</p><p>Thus, the force acting on the wall by water <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;force experienced by water jet<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>.</p></blockquote>",
